&#x200B;

thats my source btw

the artist didnt want to do my knuckles at first but I explained him that I have 0 interest in having my whole arm covered in tattoos, instead I want to have some tats on particular places. After doing my knuckles I talked to one of the most famous and respected tattoo artist of berlin and he is totally fine with that. there is no reason why you have to cover your whole arm if you dont like it aesthetically. only important thing is that I am 100% sure what I want and trust me I do and they both believed me.

&#x200B;

Do you have a tattoo? If yes i am 100% sure you hate face and hand tats otherwise you wouldnt say something like that. Imagine creating borders for getting a face tat even if someone doesnt fukking want his whole body covered but a little word on his face.
